OL,4,C'My son will die without cannabis      
OL,5,Cmedication'                            
OL,6,GA mother has said her 17-year-old son  
OL,7,Gwill die without an epilepsy medicine  
OL,8,Gwhich is set to become inaccessible in 
OL,9,Gthe UK.                                
OL,11,FJoanne, from Preston, is calling on    
OL,12,Fthe prime minister to ensure medical   
OL,13,Fcannabis will continue to be available 
OL,14,Fin the UK as her son Ben is running    
OL,15,Fout of his supply.                     
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
