OL,4,CFan found not guilty of racially       
OL,5,Cabusing Semenyo                        
OL,6,GA Liverpool fan accused of racially    
OL,7,Gabusing footballer Antoine Semenyo has 
OL,8,Gbeen found not guilty after the player 
OL,9,Gwithdrew his support for the           
OL,10,Gprosecution.                           
OL,12,FSemenyo was due to give evidence at    
OL,13,FLiverpool Magistrates' Court in the    
OL,14,Ftrial of Mark Mogan, 47, who was       
OL,15,Faccused of shouting racist abuse       
OL,16,Fduring the opening match of the        
OL,17,FPremier League season at Anfield on 15 
OL,18,FAugust last year.                      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
