OL,4,CFamilies cannot return home after      
OL,5,Cexplosives found                       
OL,6,GPeople are not expected to be able to  
OL,7,Greturn to their homes while police     
OL,8,Gcontinue a search of a house where     
OL,9,Gexplosives were discovered.            
OL,11,FA bomb disposal unit was sent to       
OL,12,FShelley Grove in Droylsden, Tameside,  
OL,13,Fon Wednesday after the discovery made  
OL,14,Fduring an "unrelated investigation".   
OL,16,FA man in his 70s and a woman in her    
OL,17,F60s were arrested on suspicion of      
OL,18,Funlawfully possessing ammunition and   
OL,19,Fexplosive substances, and a 20-year-   
OL,20,Fold man was held on criminal damage,   
OL,21,Farson and possession of ammunition.    
OL,22,FThey have all since been bailed.  G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
